<a aria-label="Icon" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=5487/bear-form"></a></div></div></div></div></div></section></div></div>
<br/>
<br/>In the pre-raid Best in Slot gear for Feral Druid DPS you're going to be wearing items from various sources. A lot of it is "Binds when equipped" which means you can get it from the Auction House, but it might cost you a good amount of gold. Item level is by far the most important thing for Feral Druid DPS, so if you see any of the alternative items down below having a close item level but more affordable for you or farmable then do not feel bad about saving gold.<br/>For Feral Druid DPS all your stats are extremely close to each other in value, except for Agility which is far ahead. Meaning that you always want to prioritize high item-level items with Agility on them.<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="body-armor">Body Armor for Feral Druid DPS</h3>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="head-for-feral-druid-dps">Head for Feral Druid DPS</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60286/stormriders-headpiece">
<img alt="Stormrider's Headpiece" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_leather_raiddruid_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Stormrider's Headpiece</span></a> is your pre-raid Best in Slot helm as a Feral Druid DPS, mostly to get the 2-set bonus, but even without the bonus it's the best helmet you can get before entering a raid with the Inferno Protocol Dungeons. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=59455/agile-bio-optic-killshades">
<img alt="Agile Bio-Optic Killshades" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gizmo_newgoggles.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Agile Bio-Optic Killshades</span></a> is basically just as good if you don't get any set bonus from wearing <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60286/stormriders-headpiece">
<img alt="Stormrider's Headpiece" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_leather_raiddruid_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Stormrider's Headpiece</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Helm Enchant</b>: <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=68766/arcanum-of-the-ramkahen">
<img alt="Arcanum of the Ramkahen" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_masterofelements.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arcanum of the Ramkahen</span></a>, requires Revered reputation with <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1173/ramkahen">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Ramkahen</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
