<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="shoulders-for-feral-druid-dps">Shoulders for Feral Druid DPS</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60289/stormriders-spaulders">
<img alt="Stormrider's Spaulders" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_leather_raiddruid_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Stormrider's Spaulders</span></a> are the best shoulders you can get before entering a raid if wearing them gives the 2-set bonus. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=59120/poison-protocol-pauldrons">
<img alt="Poison Protocol Pauldrons" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_leatherraidrogue_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Poison Protocol Pauldrons</span></a> is slightly better if you don't get the 2-set bonus.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Shoulder Enchant</b>: <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62346/greater-inscription-of-shattered-crystal">
<img alt="Greater Inscription of Shattered Crystal" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_goldendraenite_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Greater Inscription of Shattered Crystal</span></a>, requires Exalted with <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1171/therazane">
