<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="hands-for-feral-druid-dps">Hands for Feral Druid DPS</h4>Your pre-raid Best in Slot gloves are <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69942/clutches-of-evil">
<img alt="Clutches of Evil" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlet_leather_raidrogue_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Clutches of Evil</span></a>, which is crafted with <a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/skill=165/leatherworking">
<img alt="Leatherworking" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_armorkit_17.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leatherworking</span></a>, the recipe is from <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5723/firelands">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Firelands</span></a> so will likely be expensive early on. Your second-best gloves are <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71097/obsidian-arborweave-grips">
<img alt="Obsidian Arborweave Grips" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_leather_raiddruid_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Obsidian Arborweave Grips</span></a> from <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a>, these tier gloves will be your best option only if they enable one of the set bonuses.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Glove Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74255/enchant-gloves-greater-mastery">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Gloves - Greater Mastery</span></a> is taken over <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=44529/enchant-gloves-major-agility">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Gloves - Major Agility</span></a> as it provides significantly more total stats. However, the difference in damage output is negligible due to the high value of Agility.<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Glove Tinker for Engineers</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=82175/synapse-springs">
