<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="feet-for-feral-druid-dps">Feet for Feral Druid DPS</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69951/treads-of-the-craft">
<img alt="Treads of the Craft" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boot_leather_raidrogue_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Treads of the Craft</span></a> will be your pre-raid Best in Slot boots for Feral Druid DPS. They're crafted with <a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/skill=165/leatherworking">
<img alt="Leatherworking" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_armorkit_17.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leatherworking</span></a>, the recipe is from <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5723/firelands">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Firelands</span></a> so will likely be expensive early on. Your second-best option is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58482/treads-of-fleeting-joy">
<img alt="Treads of Fleeting Joy" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boot_leatherraidrogue_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Treads of Fleeting Joy</span></a>, which can be found on the Auction House or bought using <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=395/justice-points">
<span>
<img alt="Justice Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-justice.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Justice Points</span></span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Feet Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74213/enchant-boots-major-agility">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Boots - Major Agility</span></a>
