<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="jewelry">Jewelry for Feral Druid DPS</h3>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="neck-for-feral-druid-dps">Neck for Feral Druid DPS</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71129/necklace-of-smoke-signals">
<img alt="Necklace of Smoke Signals" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_ahnqiraj_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Necklace of Smoke Signals</span></a> will be your best option for the neck slot on Feral Druid DPS, which you can buy with <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a>. Any version of <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69880/mistral-pendant">
<img alt="Mistral Pendant" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/item_icecrownnecklaceb.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mistral Pendant</span></a> will be your second-best option, but you prefer "of the Windstorm" and "of the Stormblast". The other versions are just barely worse though.<div class="pad"></div>
