<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="rings-for-feral-druid-dps">Rings for Feral Druid DPS</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71209/splintered-brimstone-seal">
<img alt="Splintered Brimstone Seal" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_firelandsraid_03b.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Splintered Brimstone Seal</span></a> from <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> is by far the best ring you can get pre-raid. For your other slot <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=59121/lightning-conductor-band">
<img alt="Lightning Conductor Band" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_diamondring1.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lightning Conductor Band</span></a> will be your best option but there's three other options that are only marginally worse; <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=68812/hornet-sting-band">
<img alt="Hornet-Sting Band" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_82.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Hornet-Sting Band</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62362/signet-of-the-elder-council">
<img alt="Signet of the Elder Council" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_diamondring2.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Signet of the Elder Council</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67136/gilnean-ring-of-ruination">
<img alt="Gilnean Ring of Ruination" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_emeraldstonering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gilnean Ring of Ruination</span></a>. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=63488/mistral-circle">
<img alt="Mistral Circle" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_rubystar.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mistral Circle</span></a> of the Windstorm and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=63488/mistral-circle">
<img alt="Mistral Circle" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_rubystar.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mistral Circle</span></a> of the Stormblast are almost identical in damage output as <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=59121/lightning-conductor-band">
<img alt="Lightning Conductor Band" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_diamondring1.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lightning Conductor Band</span></a> while the other suffixes are in line with the three marginally worse options; safe to say all versions of <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=63488/mistral-circle">
<img alt="Mistral Circle" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_rubystar.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mistral Circle</span></a> are strong options.<div class="pad"></div>
