<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="trinkets-for-feral-druid-dps">Trinkets for Feral Druid DPS</h4>Feral Druid DPS loves Agility so any trinkets that provide Agility will be your strongest. The best ones that are available pre-raid are going to be <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58181/fluid-death">
<img alt="Fluid Death" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_vehicle_liquidpyrite_blue.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fluid Death</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65026/prestors-talisman-of-machination">
<img alt="Prestor's Talisman of Machination" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_17.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Prestor's Talisman of Machination</span></a>. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58181/fluid-death">
<img alt="Fluid Death" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_vehicle_liquidpyrite_blue.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fluid Death</span></a> can be bought for 1650 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=395/justice-points">
<span>
<img alt="Justice Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-justice.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Justice Points</span></span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65026/prestors-talisman-of-machination">
<img alt="Prestor's Talisman of Machination" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_17.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Prestor's Talisman of Machination</span></a> can be bought for 50 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a>. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=59520/unheeded-warning">
<img alt="Unheeded Warning" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cat_trinket11.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Unheeded Warning</span></a> and <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56328/key-to-the-endless-chamber">
<img alt="Key to the Endless Chamber" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_key_10.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Key to the Endless Chamber</span></a> are not far off either of the Best in Slot trinkets.<div class="pad"></div>
