<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="relics-for-feral-druid-dps">Relics for Feral Druid DPS</h4>For your relic slot, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71146/covenant-of-the-flame">
<img alt="Covenant of the Flame" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_scroll_15.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Covenant of the Flame</span></a> will be your pre-raid Best in Slot option. This item can be upgraded into <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71567/covenant-of-the-flame">
<img alt="Covenant of the Flame" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_scroll_15.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Covenant of the Flame</span></a> using <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71617/crystallized-firestone">
<img alt="Crystallized Firestone" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_diablostone.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Crystallized Firestone</span></a> from <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5723/firelands">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Firelands</span></a>, which is your Phase 3 Best in Slot relic. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70109/relic-of-elunes-shadow">
<img alt="Relic of Elune's Shadow" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_datacrystal12.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Relic of Elune's Shadow</span></a> from the new <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5733/molten-front">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Molten Front</span></a> quest hub is a good alternative if you don't want to spend your <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> on the relic slot.<div class="pad"></div>
